Façade: Gramazio &amp; Kohler (ETH Zurich) with Bearth &amp; Deplazes Architekten.

A study of the idea, not a copy: each brick of the infill turns by its own angle, so from afar the wall
shows large soft "grapes", close up only bricks. Here three gaussian attractors make the grapes; move the
points or add more. Bricks are laid with open joints so light comes through.
All credit for the design belongs to its authors. Units: metres.</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="5"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>40</X><Y>20</Y><W>680</W><H>150</H></item><item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>380.0</X><Y>95.0</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="PanelProperties"><items count="7"><item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36"><ARGB>255;255;250;90</ARGB></item><item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="Object" index="1"><items count="2"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">fbac3e32-f100-4292-8692-77240a42fd1a</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Contains a collection of three-dimensional points</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c7cbd88e-51a1-452c-8e41-731aad11b8cf</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Pt</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="